171168337},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implemented the production fix in `/workspace/in/flakyqueue/flakyqueue/scheduler.py`:\n\n- Uses the injected clock for task creation, readiness checks, and retry scheduling.\n- Uses the injected random source for retry jitter.\n- Removes nondeterministic ready-queue shuffling.\n- Sorts ready tasks deterministically by descending priority, then task ID.\n- Captures one timestamp for both `created_at` and `run_at`.\n\nVerification:\n\n- The requested source path was unavailable in this environment; the mounted equivalent is `/workspace/in/flakyqueue`.\n- `python -m pytest tests` could not run because `python` is unavailable.\n- `python3 -m pytest tests` could not run because `pytest` is not installed.\n- Direct scheduler contract checks passed, including ordering, injected timestamps, exact retry jitter, and retry readiness transitions.\n- `python3 -m compileall -q flakyqueue` passed.\n\nReport written to:\n\n`/workspace/out/root_cause.md`","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_00f6826facb8103b016a9553a138f087d295c5167aef2c65ee\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":1472,"output":203,"cacheRead":24320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25995,"cost":{"input":0.0002944,"output":0.00024359999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0004864,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0010244}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788171168363,"responseId":"resp_00f6826facb8103b016a9553a0abac87d2801ebe08bd5b3662","duration":4563.328964999993,"ttft":977.1491059999971}],"isTerminal":true}
